UTION AND ADVERTISING.'}{'symbol': 'PYPL', 'date': '2023-03-17 16:15:00', 'title': 'PAYPAL ANNOUNCES NEW EMPLOYEE INDUCEMENT GRANTS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF. , MARCH 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PAYPAL HOLDINGS, INC. (NASDAQ: PYPL) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS GRANTED EQUITY AWARDS ON MARCH 15, 2023, UNDER ITS 2022 INDUCEMENT EQUITY INCENTIVE PLAN (THE "PLAN") TO NEW EMPLOYEES WHO JOINED PAYPAL.'}{'symbol': 'RL', 'date': '2023-03-17 16:01:00', 'title': 'RALPH LAUREN CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--RALPH LAUREN CORPORATION (NYSE: RL) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.75 PER SHARE ON RALPH LAUREN CORPORATION COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 14, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-03-17 16:10:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, LEADING TRIAL ATTORNEYS, ENCOURAGES ROLLINS, INC. INVESTORS TO INQUIRE ABOUT SECURITIES CLASS ACTION INVESTIGATION - ROL', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, CONTINUES TO INVESTIGATE POTENTIAL SECURITIES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL) RESULTING FROM ALLEGATIONS THAT ROLLINS MAY HAVE ISSUED MATERIALLY MISLEADING BUSINESS INFORMATION TO THE INVESTING PUBLIC. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED ROLLINS SECURITIES YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2023-03-17 08:00:00', 'title': "WORLD'S BIGGEST CHIP DESIGN TECHNOLOGY USERS EVENT REOPENS LIVE IN SILICON VALLEY", 'text': "SEMICONDUCTOR INDUSTRY LUMINARIES WILL SHARE PERSPECTIVES ON THE LATEST CHIP AND SYSTEM DESIGN THINKING AS SYNOPSYS SNUG CONFERENCE RETURNS IN-PERSON ON MARCH 29, 2023 KEY HIGHLIGHTS: SNUG SILICON VALLEY RUNS MARCH 29 TO 30 AT THE SANTA CLARA CONVENTION CENTER, CALIFORNIA, WITH AROUND 2,000 LIVE ATTENDEES EXP